{"seq":9,"slug":"epidemiology-basics","title":"流行病学基础","stage":"DONE","category":"health-medicine","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"流行病学基础\">流行病学基础</h1><p>流行病学是公共卫生的方法论核心，它研究的不是某一个病人，而是「健康现象为什么在人群中这样分布」。从约翰·斯诺把霍乱死亡标在伦敦地图上，到新冠期间每个人都在谈论的再生数与群体免疫，这门学科始终在做同一件事：在无法对人随意做实验的现实里，谨慎地从观察数据逼近因果，并量化其中的不确定性，最终把判断转化为保护人群健康的行动。</p>\n<p>本 hub 按一条从抽象到具体、从原理到应用的主线展开，四个章节层层递进。</p>\n<p>第一章「流行病学原理」打地基。它先确立人群视角与「分布、决定因素、应用」三个关键词，再讲清如何把疾病频率测准（发病率、患病率及其区别），最后给出贯穿全书的因果推断框架——潜在结果、因果图与目标试验模拟。没有这一章，后面的设计与偏倚讨论都会失去坐标。</p>\n<p>第二章「研究设计」把原理落到工具。队列、病例对照、横断面与生态研究是流行病学采集证据的四种基本方式，它们在时间方向、分析单位、能算什么指标、怕什么偏倚上各有取舍。理解这些取舍，就能判断一项研究能回答什么问题、不能回答什么问题。</p>\n<p>第三章「偏倚与效应」是方法论的硬核。再好的设计也会被偏倚、混杂扭曲，本章教你识别和控制它们；又区分了「要消除的混杂」与「要报告的效应修饰」这对孪生概念；最后把诊断与筛查试验的评价讲透，揭示「准确率 99%」背后随患病率剧变的真相。</p>\n<p>第四章「应用与公共卫生」让方法落地。传染病流行病学引入风险自我繁殖的特殊框架，暴发调查是争分夺秒的现场实战，监测与循证决策则把前面所有章节的产出闭合成「预警—证据—行动—再评估」的持续循环。</p>\n<p>四章之间不是孤立的：原理为设计提供语言，设计为偏倚讨论提供场景，偏倚控制为应用提供质量保障，应用又反过来检验原理。读完全 hub，你将拥有一套在不确定中审慎判断、在压力下果断决策的流行病学思维。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"流行病学原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"definition-thinking","title":"流行病学的定义与思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations/definition-thinking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"disease-frequency","title":"疾病频率测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations/disease-frequency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-inference","title":"因果推断框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations/causal-inference"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"study-design","title":"研究设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cohort-studies","title":"队列研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design/cohort-studies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"case-control","title":"病例对照研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design/case-control"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-sectional-ecological","title":"横断面与生态研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design/cross-sectional-ecological"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"bias-effects","title":"偏倚与效应","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/bias-effects","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bias-confounding","title":"偏倚与混杂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/bias-effects/bias-confounding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"effect-modification","title":"效应修饰与交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/bias-effects/effect-modification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"screening-diagnostic","title":"筛查与诊断试验评价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/bias-effects/screening-diagnostic"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用与公共卫生","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"infectious-disease-epi","title":"传染病流行病学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/applications/infectious-disease-epi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"outbreak-investigation","title":"暴发调查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/applications/outbreak-investigation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"surveillance-evidence","title":"监测与循证决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/applications/surveillance-evidence"}]}]}